{#
  Bottom consent banner (GDPR pass, part 2 — 2026-08-30/31; wording
  shortened 2026-09-03). The site is already compliant without this: every
  .embed-gate (see contact.njk, index.njk) only loads Google Maps / the
  Facebook Page Plugin on an explicit click, so consent is already obtained
  per-embed. This banner is a convenience layer on top — one "Accept" loads
  both at once and remembers the choice (localStorage) for next time,
  instead of clicking each card.

  Accept and Refuz are deliberately the same size/effort (both one click,
  same visual weight) — CNIL fined Google and Facebook in 2022 for banners
  where "accept" was prominent and "reject" was hidden or buried; that
  asymmetry is what actually creates legal exposure, not the presence of
  a banner. No pre-ticked boxes, no accept-by-default on dismiss.

  Text kept deliberately minimal (owner call, 2026-09-03 — most visitors
  just click through and don't want to read a paragraph first). Every
  legal specific this used to spell out inline (what's loaded, when, what
  the click-to-load mechanism does, retention, etc.) already lives in full
  on privacy.html §8 — "Detalii complete" links straight there. Not shown
  on privacy.html itself (see hideConsentBanner in base.njk): that page
  has no embed-gates to act on, and it already IS the "Detalii complete"
  destination, so a second banner there would just be a confusing extra
  step for no reason.
#}
<div id="consent-banner" role="region" aria-label="Consimțământ pentru conținut extern" aria-live="polite" class="fixed bottom-0 inset-x-0 z-50 hidden px-4 pb-4">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto rounded-2xl border border-ice-200 dark:border-ice-800 bg-white dark:bg-ice-900 shadow-2xl p-5 sm:p-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3 flex-1">
        <i aria-hidden="true" class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-ice-500 dark:text-ice-300 text-xl mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
        <p class="text-sm text-ice-900/80 dark:text-ice-100/80 leading-relaxed">
          Folosim conținut extern de la <strong>Google Maps</strong> și <strong>Facebook</strong>, doar cu acordul tău.
          <a href="privacy.html" class="text-ice-700 dark:text-ice-300 font-semibold hover:underline whitespace-nowrap">Detalii complete &rarr;</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
        <button type="button" id="consent-reject"
                class="flex-1 sm:flex-none inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-ice-300 dark:border-ice-700 text-ice-900 dark:text-ice-100 font-semibold text-sm px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-ice-50 dark:hover:bg-ice-800 transition-colors">
          Refuz
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="consent-accept"
                class="flex-1 sm:flex-none inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-ice-500 hover:bg-ice-400 text-ice-950 font-semibold text-sm px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-ice-900/20 transition-colors">
          Accept
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
